  <h2>Our Mission</h2>
  <p>At Pollok Baptist Church, our mission is to connect others to Christ through acts of love and discipleship. Our community is built on the foundation of compassion, ensuring a supportive space for personal and spiritual development, where each individual can discover and nurture their faith journey.</p>

  <h2>Who We Are</h2>
  <p>Pollok Baptist Church is a small country church in the piney woods of Deep East Texas, about fifteen miles north of Lufkin on Highway 7 West. Our members come from the surrounding communities, and we have a big heart for worshiping the Lord, fellowshipping with one another and with neighboring churches, and welcoming visitors with open arms.</p>

